    "category": "rule",
    "excerpt": "The market makes a new 20day high or low and the previous high/low marker must have been at least 3 trading sessions prior. \u2026 The close of the new high/low must be greater than (beyond) the previous high/low price marker. \u2026 Buy entry is placed on the next day at the previous 20 day high/low watermark \u2026 Stop entries for failed trades are placed below the latest high/low that triggered the signal \u2026 Profits/exits should be taken within 2-6 candlestick intervals \u2026 OHLCV historical data for Bitcoin (BTC) from Binance exchange.",
    "performance_claim": null,
    "verbatim_confidence": "high",
    "notes": "Turtle Soup 20-day false-breakout rule on Binance BTC daily; exit window 2-6 bars is a range (compiler must pick)."
  },
